# Conduck — Product-Specific Environment Variables (Template)
# ============================================================================
# Conduck has NO backend (skeleton.md §3) — this file is NOT consumed at
# build, test, or runtime. It exists as a paste-source: copy values into the
# iOS sim Settings > API Key field (per active STT preset) during W6 manual
# verification across the 5 providers shipped in P0.W6.5.
#
# Setup:
#   cp Conduck/.env.example Conduck/.env
#   # Fill in real values, then in sim: Settings → switch STT preset → paste.
#
# Recreate per checkout — `.env` is gitignored, do NOT symlink across
# worktrees (cf. feedback_storyline_env_per_checkout).
# ============================================================================

# ============================================
# STT Provider Keys (P0.W6.5 — 5 providers, user-selectable)
# ============================================
# Preset IDs are LOCKED (Keychain account suffix depends — DO NOT RENAME):
#   mistral-voxtral · openai-gpt4o-transcribe · elevenlabs-scribe-v2
#   gemini-3-1-flash-lite · qwen3-asr-flash
#
# Status: shipped W6.5, NOT YET TESTED end-to-end across providers
# (W6 manual verification is the next wave).

# Mistral Voxtral V2 (`voxtral-mini-2602`) — DEFAULT preset
# https://console.mistral.ai/api-keys
# Probe: GET https://api.mistral.ai/v1/models  (free)
MISTRAL_API_KEY=your_mistral_api_key_here

# OpenAI `gpt-4o-transcribe`
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# Probe: GET https://api.openai.com/v1/models  (free)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your_openai_api_key_here

# ElevenLabs `scribe_v2`
# https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
# Probe: GET https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/user  (free)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_elevenlabs_api_key_here

# Google Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite — Conduck-dedicated key (NOT the shared
# root `GEMINI_API_KEY`, which is reserved for image-gen / marketing tooling)
# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Probe: GET https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models  (free)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_conduck_gemini_api_key_here

# Alibaba Qwen3-ASR-Flash via DashScope (Alibaba Cloud Model Studio)
# Conduck targets the INTERNATIONAL (Singapore) endpoint —
# `dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com`. Keys are region-scoped: a Beijing/China-
# mainland key will NOT authenticate against the international base URL
# (and vice versa). Get an international key from Alibaba Cloud Model
# Studio's international console (NOT the mainland `aliyun.com` console).
# https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/first-api-call-to-qwen
# Probe: POST bundled silent-WAV (no free metadata endpoint — minimal credit
# burn on key save; see skeleton.md §3.6 locked decision)
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=sk-your_dashscope_intl_api_key_here
